1
00:02:24,060 --> 00:02:25,700
We interrupt this broadcast with breaking news.

2
00:02:25,920 --> 00:02:27,620
At 2:10 this afternoon,

3
00:02:27,820 --> 00:02:30,600
the newly built Jianzhou Tunnel in Jianzhou City collapsed.

4
00:02:30,860 --> 00:02:33,140
Rescue teams have rushed to the scene,

5
00:02:33,400 --> 00:02:35,600
and search and rescue operations are underway.

6
00:02:35,980 --> 00:02:37,440
For more details on the incident,

7
00:02:37,500 --> 00:02:38,980
we will continue to provide live coverage.

8
00:02:53,140 --> 00:02:53,780
Hurry!

9
00:02:54,380 --> 00:02:55,140
Hurry up!

10
00:02:55,460 --> 00:02:56,220
Lift him onto the bed here.

11
00:02:56,460 --> 00:02:57,760
One, two, three.

12
00:03:00,100 --> 00:03:00,620
Scissors!

13
00:03:15,720 --> 00:03:16,380
Yao Yang,

14
00:03:16,680 --> 00:03:18,000
a local construction contractor,

15
00:03:18,200 --> 00:03:19,180
49 years old.

16
00:03:19,860 --> 00:03:21,440
Four years ago, through subcontracting,

17
00:03:21,820 --> 00:03:23,380
he took over the Jianzhou Tunnel project.

18
00:03:24,440 --> 00:03:26,300
He was later jailed over a tunnel collapse

19
00:03:26,740 --> 00:03:28,000
and released three months ago.

20
00:03:29,080 --> 00:03:29,840
This morning,

21
00:03:30,020 --> 00:03:32,140
he drank pesticide on a livestream.

22
00:03:32,140 --> 00:03:33,100
Now, online,

23
00:03:33,100 --> 00:03:34,180
many content creators are sharing it.

24
00:03:35,020 --> 00:03:35,900
Comrade Geng Qing,

25
00:03:36,700 --> 00:03:38,140
what are your thoughts on this?

26
00:03:39,060 --> 00:03:42,060
Yao Yang sent his report to the Discipline and Inspection Committee.

27
00:03:42,060 --> 00:03:43,420
The core allegation

28
00:03:43,580 --> 00:03:45,020
is that back then,

29
00:03:45,140 --> 00:03:46,200
in the Jianzhou Tunnel case,

30
00:03:46,520 --> 00:03:48,140
there were illegal bidding practices.

31
00:03:48,780 --> 00:03:50,300
A man just released from prison,

32
00:03:50,460 --> 00:03:54,020
blowing this up through a suicide livestream—

33
00:03:54,340 --> 00:03:56,820
Is someone behind this manipulating him?

34
00:03:57,340 --> 00:03:58,860
Whether the allegations are true or false,

35
00:03:58,860 --> 00:04:00,100
we must investigate thoroughly

36
00:04:00,460 --> 00:04:01,820
and give the public the truth.

37
00:04:02,220 --> 00:04:03,660
Well said, Comrade Geng Qing.

38
00:04:04,080 --> 00:04:05,920
Now, not just in bidding,

39
00:04:06,480 --> 00:04:09,400
but across all industries and fields,

40
00:04:09,640 --> 00:04:11,120
what do the people want most?

41
00:04:11,520 --> 00:04:15,440
They want openness, fairness, and justice.

42
00:04:15,900 --> 00:04:17,880
What hurts the business environment most?

43
00:04:18,000 --> 00:04:20,240
It's wearing a legal facade

44
00:04:20,240 --> 00:04:22,200
while engaging in illegal activities.

45
00:04:22,480 --> 00:04:23,900
This Yao Yang,

46
00:04:24,640 --> 00:04:27,900
he has a record and served prison time.

47
00:04:28,620 --> 00:04:29,920
He doesn't even care about his own life,

48
00:04:30,420 --> 00:04:33,020
crying foul through a suicide livestream.

49
00:04:33,200 --> 00:04:34,960
Does he have a major grievance?

50
00:04:35,560 --> 00:04:36,680
For a long time,

51
00:04:36,920 --> 00:04:39,120
the bidding field in construction projects

52
00:04:39,120 --> 00:04:41,320
has seen frequent corruption.

53
00:04:41,500 --> 00:04:43,660
It harms market fairness and justice

54
00:04:43,660 --> 00:04:45,300
and the business environment,

55
00:04:45,600 --> 00:04:47,660
hurts the interests of the people,

56
00:04:47,980 --> 00:04:50,780
severely damages government credibility,

57
00:04:51,060 --> 00:04:53,980
and harms the Party's public image.

58
00:04:54,380 --> 00:04:55,180
I propose that,

59
00:04:55,580 --> 00:04:57,320
based on the leads from this report

60
00:04:57,560 --> 00:04:59,140
regarding bidding violations,

61
00:04:59,500 --> 00:05:01,060
we establish a Task Force

62
00:05:01,420 --> 00:05:04,780
to thoroughly probe corruption in bidding.

63
00:05:04,980 --> 00:05:06,280
No matter who is involved,

64
00:05:06,700 --> 00:05:07,820
we will investigate to the very end.

65
00:05:08,080 --> 00:05:11,000
As this involves crimes under police jurisdiction

66
00:05:11,120 --> 00:05:13,400
and duty crimes under the Discipline and Inspection Committee,

67
00:05:13,480 --> 00:05:14,740
according to relevant regulations,

68
00:05:15,080 --> 00:05:15,800
in this case,

69
00:05:15,940 --> 00:05:17,200
the Discipline and Inspection Committee will lead,

70
00:05:17,540 --> 00:05:18,520
with the police assisting,

71
00:05:19,020 --> 00:05:20,960
to conduct the investigation by the law.

72
00:05:21,520 --> 00:05:22,620
I will serve as general commander.

73
00:05:23,260 --> 00:05:24,940
Comrade Liu Wei will co-command.

74
00:05:25,160 --> 00:05:27,420
Comrade Geng Qing will head the Task Force,

75
00:05:27,560 --> 00:05:29,320
and Comrade Lin Lan will be deputy head.

76
00:05:29,720 --> 00:05:30,640
I agree.

77
00:05:30,940 --> 00:05:32,460
Led by the Discipline and Inspection Committee,

78
00:05:33,180 --> 00:05:34,980
our public security organs will fully assist.

79
00:05:35,820 --> 00:05:38,320
Comrade Lin Lan will oversee the police side.

80
00:05:38,740 --> 00:05:39,380
Understood.

81
00:05:40,100 --> 00:05:41,000
Comrade Geng Qing.

82
00:05:41,860 --> 00:05:42,820
Comrade Geng Qing.

83
00:05:43,880 --> 00:05:45,760
You will head the Task Force.

84
00:05:50,440 --> 00:05:51,240
Secretary,

85
00:05:52,040 --> 00:05:54,040
I request to recuse myself.

86
00:05:54,700 --> 00:05:55,500
Your reason?

87
00:05:55,920 --> 00:05:57,880
Jinxin Company, mentioned in the report—

88
00:05:57,960 --> 00:05:59,880
its actual controller, Du Qingbo,

89
00:06:01,400 --> 00:06:04,040
was my college classmate.

90
00:06:12,140 --> 00:06:12,860
Mr. Du.

91
00:06:14,120 --> 00:06:15,600
Yao Yang drank pesticide on a livestream.

92
00:06:16,520 --> 00:06:18,560
He also filed a real-name report about

93
00:06:18,560 --> 00:06:21,200
bid rigging on the Jianzhou Tunnel project.

94
00:06:23,680 --> 00:06:24,880
Is he dead?

95
00:06:25,160 --> 00:06:26,240
They're still trying to save him.

96
00:06:27,080 --> 00:06:27,940
Look.

97
00:06:32,520 --> 00:06:33,720
You touched my flowers.

98
00:06:33,960 --> 00:06:34,400
Huh?

99
00:06:35,260 --> 00:06:36,440
Tending flowers

100
00:06:37,280 --> 00:06:38,600
is just like handling business.

101
00:06:39,120 --> 00:06:40,160
Which branch to prune,

102
00:06:40,160 --> 00:06:41,280
which branch to leave alone—

103
00:06:41,800 --> 00:06:43,000
you must figure that out first.

104
00:06:47,880 --> 00:06:50,080
We're only a bidding agency.

105
00:06:50,320 --> 00:06:52,800
The winning bidder subcontracted it out layer by layer.

106
00:06:53,160 --> 00:06:54,520
It has nothing to do with us.

107
00:06:55,080 --> 00:06:57,460
Then what about the two

108
00:06:57,460 --> 00:06:58,860
lavish feasts we have coming up?

109
00:07:01,220 --> 00:07:03,280
We used to be very close.

110
00:07:03,560 --> 00:07:05,500
He even saved my life once.

111
00:07:05,640 --> 00:07:07,600
In recent years, his business grew,

112
00:07:08,000 --> 00:07:08,980
and we lost touch.

113
00:07:10,160 --> 00:07:12,640
So I believe I should recuse myself.

114
00:07:12,840 --> 00:07:14,000
What you just explained—

115
00:07:14,360 --> 00:07:15,460
I'm already aware of it.

116
00:07:15,640 --> 00:07:16,840
I have only one question.

117
00:07:17,200 --> 00:07:20,040
If your old classmate Du Qingbo is suspected,

118
00:07:20,040 --> 00:07:21,320
what is your stance?

119
00:07:21,880 --> 00:07:22,720
Enforce discipline impartially,

120
00:07:22,920 --> 00:07:23,920
with a clear conscience.

121
00:07:24,160 --> 00:07:25,040
Say it again.

122
00:07:29,500 --> 00:07:30,440
Enforce discipline impartially,

123
00:07:30,640 --> 00:07:31,720
with a clear conscience.

124
00:07:32,100 --> 00:07:32,740
Good.

125
00:07:33,820 --> 00:07:36,360
Regarding your request for recusal,

126
00:07:36,360 --> 00:07:37,480
my answer is:

127
00:07:37,480 --> 00:07:38,480
Recusal denied.

128
00:07:39,280 --> 00:07:40,120
I agree.

129
00:07:40,800 --> 00:07:42,040
I'll obey the organization's decision.

130
00:07:43,560 --> 00:07:44,260
Young Master Qin.

131
00:07:45,720 --> 00:07:46,940
I saw it online.

132
00:07:47,400 --> 00:07:48,440
Let me tell you,

133
00:07:48,680 --> 00:07:49,840
for a project this big,

134
00:07:50,260 --> 00:07:51,220
don't you waver.

135
00:07:52,640 --> 00:07:54,960
But serving two banquets at once...

136
00:07:55,360 --> 00:07:56,600
makes the target too big.

137
00:07:56,960 --> 00:07:58,720
Besides, we're right in the eye of the storm.

138
00:07:59,280 --> 00:08:00,080
What storm?

139
00:08:00,980 --> 00:08:02,360
It's nothing but clear skies.

140
00:08:03,340 --> 00:08:04,200
Backing out now

141
00:08:04,740 --> 00:08:06,140
is as good as a confession.

142
00:08:08,140 --> 00:08:10,420
Right now, the Discipline and Inspection Committee—

143
00:08:10,660 --> 00:08:11,400
Forget the Discipline and Inspection Committee!

144
00:08:11,960 --> 00:08:12,560
Cut the nonsense.

145
00:08:13,080 --> 00:08:14,180
We have to push forward, risks or not.

146
00:08:15,000 --> 00:08:15,960
If push comes to shove,

147
00:08:16,600 --> 00:08:19,860
your recordings will come in handy.

148
00:08:27,860 --> 00:08:28,980
Who would've thought Team Leader Geng's

149
00:08:28,980 --> 00:08:29,980
first strike in office

150
00:08:29,980 --> 00:08:31,280
would fall on an old friend?

151
00:08:34,160 --> 00:08:35,960
That's why I asked to recuse myself.

152
00:08:36,880 --> 00:08:38,880
Then shouldn't I recuse myself too?

153
00:08:39,480 --> 00:08:40,280
Why?

154
00:08:40,720 --> 00:08:43,320
We agreed to meet at Four Seasons last Saturday.

155
00:08:43,680 --> 00:08:45,000
Why didn't a certain someone show up?

156
00:08:46,640 --> 00:08:49,680
That family-oriented, virtuous person...

157
00:08:49,680 --> 00:08:51,040
It couldn't be you, could it?

158
00:09:00,280 --> 00:09:00,880
Team Leader.

159
00:09:02,960 --> 00:09:03,560
Team Leader.

160
00:09:05,280 --> 00:09:05,660
Team Leader.

161
00:09:06,400 --> 00:09:06,860
Team Leader.

162
00:09:13,040 --> 00:09:13,940
Comrades,

163
00:09:16,180 --> 00:09:17,440
time waits for no one.

164
00:09:17,760 --> 00:09:19,080
You're all briefed on the case, right?

165
00:09:19,640 --> 00:09:21,720
Let me go over it with everyone again.

166
00:09:23,420 --> 00:09:26,320
The whistleblower's name is Yao Yang.

167
00:09:26,460 --> 00:09:27,380
Forty-nine years old.

168
00:09:27,580 --> 00:09:29,640
A local construction contractor.

169
00:09:30,160 --> 00:09:32,400
He's divorced and served time in prison.

170
00:09:32,960 --> 00:09:34,000
While he was incarcerated,

171
00:09:34,000 --> 00:09:36,040
his daughter passed away from illness.

172
00:09:36,320 --> 00:09:38,120
These were crushing blows.

173
00:09:38,200 --> 00:09:40,080
Why would a case from four years ago

174
00:09:40,320 --> 00:09:41,720
only be reported now?

175
00:09:41,880 --> 00:09:43,720
And in such an extreme manner?

176
00:09:44,160 --> 00:09:45,360
Think about that.

177
00:09:45,640 --> 00:09:46,500
In addition,

178
00:09:47,120 --> 00:09:48,220
the report letter

179
00:09:48,500 --> 00:09:49,860
also mentions a company:

180
00:09:50,260 --> 00:09:51,360
Jinxin Company.

181
00:09:51,580 --> 00:09:53,560
This is a renowned

182
00:09:53,560 --> 00:09:55,280
bidding agency in our city.

183
00:09:55,720 --> 00:09:58,040
Projects they handled in the past five years

184
00:09:58,360 --> 00:10:01,120
had total investments exceeding 20 billion yuan.

185
00:10:01,320 --> 00:10:02,560
Some comrades may not be

186
00:10:02,560 --> 00:10:04,480
very familiar with bidding and tendering.

187
00:10:04,640 --> 00:10:06,080
So let me briefly explain.

188
00:10:08,760 --> 00:10:10,200
Here's the general process:

189
00:10:10,720 --> 00:10:13,000
The project owner entrusts the agency.

190
00:10:13,280 --> 00:10:16,320
The agency prepares tenders and posts notices,

191
00:10:16,400 --> 00:10:17,320
then organizes the bid opening.

192
00:10:17,500 --> 00:10:19,420
Bidders download the tender documents

193
00:10:19,480 --> 00:10:20,200
and prepare their bids.

194
00:10:20,480 --> 00:10:21,820
The bid opening and evaluation

195
00:10:21,820 --> 00:10:23,800
take place at the Public Resource Trading Center.

196
00:10:23,800 --> 00:10:26,680
Experts are randomly chosen by the system.

197
00:10:26,760 --> 00:10:28,400
Two hours after selection,

198
00:10:28,400 --> 00:10:31,240
the experts arrive to evaluate the bids.

199
00:10:31,280 --> 00:10:34,000
Then the winning bid is announced.

200
00:10:34,480 --> 00:10:37,000
Director Geng, this firm sounds powerless.

201
00:10:37,000 --> 00:10:38,240
Just an errand boy.

202
00:10:39,060 --> 00:10:39,540
Right.

203
00:10:40,120 --> 00:10:42,280
On the surface, that's certainly how it looks.

204
00:10:42,640 --> 00:10:44,920
But the problem lies in two areas.

205
00:10:45,360 --> 00:10:47,960
First, the barrier to entry is too low.

206
00:10:48,520 --> 00:10:50,240
Starting in late 2017,

207
00:10:50,920 --> 00:10:52,240
bidding agencies

208
00:10:52,300 --> 00:10:53,840
no longer required prior

209
00:10:54,320 --> 00:10:55,320
qualification approval.

210
00:10:55,320 --> 00:10:57,200
In other words, you, me,

211
00:10:57,360 --> 00:10:59,000
or anyone off the street

212
00:10:59,160 --> 00:11:01,860
can set up such a firm and start working.

213
00:11:02,340 --> 00:11:04,700
Second, its hidden power is considerable.

214
00:11:05,680 --> 00:11:07,120
Sure, the experts

215
00:11:07,120 --> 00:11:08,460
are randomly selected.

216
00:11:08,720 --> 00:11:11,840
But who writes the tender documents?

217
00:11:12,120 --> 00:11:14,200
Who runs the entire process?

218
00:11:14,200 --> 00:11:15,440
The agency does.

219
00:11:16,560 --> 00:11:17,640
In other words,

220
00:11:17,880 --> 00:11:20,440
as long as the agency tampers a bit

221
00:11:20,440 --> 00:11:23,000
with the tender documents and grading criteria,

222
00:11:23,440 --> 00:11:25,940
or even obtains the expert list in advance,

223
00:11:26,600 --> 00:11:28,920
it may seem open and fair on the surface,

224
00:11:29,280 --> 00:11:32,240
but the outcome was rigged long before.

225
00:11:32,600 --> 00:11:34,800
Exactly. In this industry, that's

226
00:11:35,120 --> 00:11:38,280
classic bid rigging, collusion, and selling.

227
00:11:39,040 --> 00:11:41,520
Through behind-the-scenes manipulation,

228
00:11:42,800 --> 00:11:43,740
the agency awards the project

229
00:11:44,700 --> 00:11:47,600
to the preselected bidder,

230
00:11:47,840 --> 00:11:50,760
taking kickbacks and cuts in return.

231
00:11:51,240 --> 00:11:52,720
Think about it.

232
00:11:52,720 --> 00:11:54,040
On a one-billion-yuan project,

233
00:11:54,040 --> 00:11:55,600
one percent is ten million.

234
00:11:55,800 --> 00:11:57,760
Five percent is 50 million.

235
00:11:58,120 --> 00:11:59,320
What about projects worth billions,

236
00:11:59,320 --> 00:12:00,840
or tens of billions?

237
00:12:01,420 --> 00:12:02,960
How deep do these waters run?

238
00:12:03,240 --> 00:12:04,600
You can only imagine.

239
00:12:06,120 --> 00:12:06,700
Team Leader Lin,

240
00:12:06,800 --> 00:12:07,260
the floor is yours.

241
00:12:11,680 --> 00:12:12,480
Du Qingbo.

242
00:12:14,600 --> 00:12:16,480
The de facto controller of Jinxin Company.

243
00:12:16,480 --> 00:12:20,280
He once headed the Housing Bureau's legal section.

244
00:12:20,480 --> 00:12:22,720
Later, he quit to get into tender brokering.

245
00:12:23,460 --> 00:12:27,320
Insiders say he's deeply connected.

246
00:12:27,820 --> 00:12:28,580
Captain Lin,

247
00:12:28,880 --> 00:12:30,200
we've checked him out.

248
00:12:30,280 --> 00:12:31,400
His background is spotless.

249
00:12:31,560 --> 00:12:32,840
No criminal record whatsoever.

250
00:12:32,880 --> 00:12:33,800
The cleaner it looks,

251
00:12:34,280 --> 00:12:35,640
the more suspicious it is.

252
00:12:36,600 --> 00:12:37,120
Come on.

253
00:12:37,380 --> 00:12:38,400
Let's get to work, everyone.

254
00:12:58,920 --> 00:12:59,720
Team Leader.

255
00:13:00,320 --> 00:13:02,400
Projects handled by Jinxin Company over the years...

256
00:13:02,400 --> 00:13:03,640
we've reviewed them twice.

257
00:13:03,640 --> 00:13:04,720
Procedurally, they're fully compliant.

258
00:13:05,200 --> 00:13:07,400
The Jianzhou Tunnel case from four years ago is clean.

259
00:13:07,440 --> 00:13:08,760
There are no suspicious leads for now.

260
00:13:08,880 --> 00:13:10,160
Should we question him?

261
00:13:10,580 --> 00:13:11,760
Given the current situation,

262
00:13:11,920 --> 00:13:12,800
with insufficient evidence,

263
00:13:12,920 --> 00:13:14,120
we'd only tip them off.

264
00:13:16,480 --> 00:13:19,080
These two projects total billions in investment.

265
00:13:19,760 --> 00:13:21,000
They won't give up.

266
00:13:25,840 --> 00:13:29,440
Request to move supervision forward for major projects.

267
00:13:29,760 --> 00:13:31,840
Cross-verify the case from four years ago.

268
00:13:32,000 --> 00:13:33,080
Dig deeper to uncover related cases.

269
00:13:34,720 --> 00:13:35,520
Comrades,

270
00:13:36,120 --> 00:13:38,840
someone risked their life to blow the whistle,

271
00:13:38,880 --> 00:13:40,520
and leadership at all levels takes it seriously.

272
00:13:40,880 --> 00:13:43,400
We must investigate this case to the very end.

273
00:13:43,400 --> 00:13:44,320
Yes, sir!
